    "description": "This API facilitates the provisioning of eSIMs for telecom services, enabling seamless integration and management of electronic SIM cards. It allows service providers to automate the onboarding process, ensuring customers can quickly access mobile services. Common use cases include activating new eSIM profiles and modifying existing ones, which is crucial for delivering timely services to end-users. This is typically utilized by telecom operators and application developers focusing on enhancing customer experiences.",
